        "description": "Send a message to a running local agent by agent id. Success only means the message was queued for the target local agent.\n\nUsage:\n- Use only for explicit local_agent coordination or handoff.\n- Do not claim the target agent has read, accepted, or replied to the message.\n- Include enough context for the target agent to understand the request.\n- Use { to, summary, message } with the agent id returned by the Agent tool.",
